    "The CodeDeploy agent on an instance continuously polls the CodeDeploy service for a new deployment.",
    "When a new deployment is detected, the agent runs the scripts defined in appspec.yml (or apps.yaml).",
    "The scripts can include installing Docker/CLI, running setup commands, validating, and starting the application.",
    "CodeDeploy service creates the deployment, but the agent on the machine actually runs the commands.",
    "In an Auto Scaling Group setup, the ASG launches EC2 instances from a launch template with the agent pre-installed.",
    "The ASG launches instances according to the desired capacity.",
    "The agent’s duties remain the same on each instance.",
    "The agent runs on every instance the ASG launches as part of the deployment.",
    "The deployment is triggered after CI pushes images to ECR and the CD pipeline runs.",
